msgid "these GGUF files are not one split model: they disagree about '%(key)s', declaring %(values)s"
msgstr "fail GGUF ini bukan satu model split: semuanya tidak sependapat tentang '%(key)s', dan mengisytiharkan %(values)s"

msgid "Pass the shards of one model, not of several."
msgstr "Berikan shard bagi satu model, bukan bagi beberapa model."

msgid "no GGUF header to read facts from"
msgstr "tiada pengepala GGUF untuk membaca fakta"

msgid "Pass the model's file, or every shard of a split model."
msgstr "Berikan fail model itu, atau setiap shard bagi sebuah model split."

msgid "%(count)d GGUF file of the %(total)d given carries no '%(key)s' key, so its place in a split model cannot be established"
msgid_plural "%(count)d GGUF files of the %(total)d given carry no '%(key)s' key, so their place in a split model cannot be established"
msgstr[0] "%(count)d fail GGUF daripada %(total)d yang diberikan tidak membawa kunci '%(key)s', jadi kedudukannya dalam model split tidak dapat ditentukan"

msgid "Pass a single unsplit file on its own, or every shard of one split model."
msgstr "Berikan satu fail utuh tanpa split, atau setiap shard bagi satu model split."

msgid "incomplete shard set: the model declares %(shards)s and %(arrived)d arrived (%(key)s %(numbers)s)"
msgstr "set shard tidak lengkap: model itu mengisytiharkan %(shards)s dan %(arrived)d yang tiba (%(key)s %(numbers)s)"

msgid "Pass every shard of the split model."
msgstr "Berikan setiap shard bagi model split itu."

msgid "the shard holding the model's metadata is missing: got %(key)s %(numbers)s, expected one of them to be 0"
msgstr "shard yang memegang metadata model itu tiada: dapat %(key)s %(numbers)s, salah satunya sepatutnya 0"

msgid "Pass every shard of the split model, including the first."
msgstr "Berikan setiap shard bagi model split itu, termasuk yang pertama."

msgid "incomplete shard set: expected %(key)s 0 to %(last)d, got %(numbers)s"
msgstr "set shard tidak lengkap: dijangka %(key)s 0 hingga %(last)d, dapat %(numbers)s"

msgid "Pass each shard of the split model exactly once."
msgstr "Berikan setiap shard bagi model split itu tepat sekali."

msgid "incomplete shard set: the model declares %(tensors)s and its %(shards)s hold %(held)d between them"
msgstr "set shard tidak lengkap: model itu mengisytiharkan %(tensors)s dan %(shards)s miliknya hanya mengandungi %(held)d antara semuanya"

